WEBVTT

00:20:57.600 --> 00:21:00.261
people around her noticed a new Joanne.

00:21:00.285 --> 00:21:03.336
Stephanie Williams McConnell:
Her perspective absolutely changed

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:06.730
in terms of, "OK, this feels
really important today,

00:21:06.754 --> 00:21:10.286
but in six months, it's not
going to feel as important,

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:13.768
and let's make sure that
my health, my well-being,

00:21:13.792 --> 00:21:17.249
all of those types of things
aren't being compromised,

00:21:17.273 --> 00:21:20.296
because in six months,
those things will still matter."

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:23.626
That's Joanne's boss,
Stephanie Winters McConnell.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:26.906
Note, don't get me wrong --
Joanne still works hard.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.372
JM: I'm definitely committed,

00:21:28.396 --> 00:21:30.436
I'm dedicated, I'm driven.